                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Welcome to the",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Ease Up Service ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#018db1"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "report",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This report has been created to automate Ease Up reporting to MoH.  Each line number in the templates relate to the line in the reporting spreadsheet.  (as at October 2022).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "On this Home Page you can select the filters you wish to create the data you want to see.  You can also change these filters on each individual page.  'X' will clear these filters back to their original state without selection.  (A team region must be chosen, the default is Waitemata - for no particular reason).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Select the",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#7355a3"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "financial year",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#7355a3"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " (or years) you wish to look at the data for.  You may select for all financial years.  Waitemata began its Ease Up service in June 2021 and Waikato a year later in June 2022.  Regions are 'hard coded'.  If a new Ease Up Service begins in another region, please contact the Business Intelligence Team.  Without changing the report they will appear in the 'Other Region' category in Team Region.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "You may select the team name.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The reporting templates: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Template Activity and Template Session and Client Characteristics follow the MoH line for line.  Right click on any figure and it will link to a drill down.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Please choose the line of the page you wish.  ie.  if you are on Line 27: Number of sessions one person, right click the number of the month you like, then choose drill down, then the corresponding data which will be '27: Session Details'.  Unfortunately, the drill down will give you the option to choose all drill down pages.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
